# Normalise line endings in this repository, while each machine keeps its own working copy in
# the form it prefers. Until this folder became a repository of its own the rule lived in the
# monorepo's .gitattributes, a file this repository does not carry.
#
# Types listed below are the ones actually tracked here, counted rather than guessed. This mod
# is XML and documentation only: no assembly, no source folder.

* text=auto

# ---------- Text ----------

*.xml text
*.md  text

# ---------- Binaries: neither normalised nor diffed as text ----------

*.png binary
